    "faq": [
        {
            "question": "What are the key differences between AG Grid and Kendo UI?",
            "answer": "AG Grid is one grid for React, Angular, Vue and plain JavaScript, with a free, MIT-licensed Community edition. Kendo UI Grid is sold as separate libraries for each framework, and only the React library, KendoReact, has a free tier. AG Grid includes pivoting and tree data in the grid itself; Kendo provides them as separate PivotGrid and TreeList components."
        },
        {
            "question": "What is a Kendo grid?",
            "answer": "Kendo UI Grid is a data grid component from Progress Telerik. It is available as separate libraries for React (KendoReact), Angular, Vue and jQuery."
        },
        {
            "question": "Is Kendo grid free?",
            "answer": "Only for React. KendoReact Free includes the Grid with a reduced feature set; row virtualisation, multi-column sorting, grouping, locked columns and Excel export are premium. Kendo UI for Angular, Vue and jQuery need a trial or commercial licence, and the free, open-source Kendo UI Core does not include the Grid. The Kendo UI subscription, covering all four libraries, is listed from $799 per developer per year."
        },
        {
            "question": "Does AG Grid work with Angular?",
            "answer": "Yes. AG Grid has official packages for Angular, React and Vue, and can be used with plain JavaScript. See [Getting Started](./getting-started/)."
        },
        {
            "question": "Can I use AG Grid for free?",
            "answer": "Yes. AG Grid Community is free and open source under the MIT licence, including for commercial use. AG Grid Enterprise is a paid licence that adds features such as row grouping, pivoting, Excel export and the Server-Side Row Model. See [Community vs Enterprise](./community-vs-enterprise/)."
        },
        {
            "question": "How much does an AG Grid licence cost?",
            "answer": "AG Grid Community is free. AG Grid Enterprise, and the Enterprise Bundle with AG Charts Enterprise, are perpetual licences priced per developer, with one year of updates and support. [Configure your licence](/license-pricing/) to see your price."
        }
    ],
